cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Le Mirouer des simples âmes: annotated corpus and dialogue network"
message: "If you use this corpus or the speaker-extraction protocol, please cite it."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable corpus of Marguerite Porete's Le Mirouer des simples âmes
  anienties (Middle French, Chantilly manuscript), with a documented
  speaker-extraction protocol and a reproducible analysis of the distribution
  of dialogue turns among its allegorical figures.
keywords:
  - digital humanities
  - computational philology
  - Middle French
  - Marguerite Porete
  - character networks
  - grammatical gender
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - given-names: "Verónica"
    family-names: "Zumpano Blumenfeld"
